  "page": 34,
  "quote": "will include a jaw crusher as the primary stage and a cone crusher for secondary size reduction. The crushed ore will be ground by a ball mill in closed circuit with a hydrocyclone cluster. The hydrocyclone overflow with P80 of 150 mesh (106 µm) will flow to a hybrid leach/carbon-in-leach (CIL) recovery circuit via a pre-aeration tank. Gold and silver leached in the CIL circuit will be recovered onto activated carbon and eluted in a pressurized Zadra-style elution circuit and then recovered by electrowinning in the gold room."
 },
